nor stewardship, grant writing, and event support.</p></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@onceuponatime.org?subject=Application%20-%20Development%20Associate">Apply <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></article><article style="background:var(--snow);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius: var(--radius-md);padding:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center"><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--pillar)">Operations Manager</h3><p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin:0 0 8px">Full-time · $65–$78k · In-studio Queens</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;margin:0">Books, accounting, vendor relationships, facility ops.</p></div><a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@onceuponatime.org?subject=Application%20-%20Operations%20Manager">Apply <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></article>
      </div>
